(Fixture plate for Hammond 1590DD top panel milling)
(Origin: plate center = wasteboard carriage hole center)
(Material: 15mm MDF — cut on the SRcnc)
(Tool: 4.0mm single flute endmill)
(Feed XY: 800 mm/min, Z: 150 mm/min)
(Spindle: 10000 RPM)

